== Reward ==

<ul><li> {{:Red Dragonscale Armor}}
</li></ul>

== Checklist ==

[[Karam Dragonforge]] is located at +4105, +920, 4.51 in the Mountain of Rathe (the "human inn"). He wants the following items:
{{CheckboxList}}
* [[Red Dragon Scales]] from [[Lord Nagafen]] or [[Talendor]]
* [[Vial of Swirling Smoke]] (vendor - see item page notes for tips to acquire)
* 1000 platinum pieces

Note: As of 8-17-26, I handed in all items, got the armor and Karam gave back the 1,000 platinum.  The Vial of Swirling Smoke was 1,200 platinum, though. Left it in place, however, in case this is patched out. Wouldn't want you to be surprised.
{{End}}

== Dialogue ==

You say, 'Hail, Karam Dragonforge'

:Karam Dragonforge says 'Welcome, ___. I have a number of platemail items, if you are interested. I am also a master [smith] of exotic materials such as dragon scales.'

You say, 'A master smith of what?'

:Karam Dragonforge says 'Dragon scales make terrfic armor. I can make a [white dragonscale cloak] and [red dragonscale armor]. I have not seen any other colored dragon variants around. But if you see any, be sure to let me know. I would be interested in what can be made from their scales.'

You say, 'What red dragonscale armor?'

:Karam Dragonforge says 'So you have a red dragon scale, eh? Well, I am wanting very much to return to my fiancee and propose to her. If you could aid me in quickly returning to her with a bit of spare change, we could have a deal. Heck, for the armor, a vial of swirling smoke and 1000 platinum coins is a bargain!'

After turn in:

:Karam Dragonforge says 'Wonderful! Now I can get back to my fiance instantly! Isn't Love grand! As for your red dragonscale armor, it is all done. Farewell!'

